lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8629, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012NviShNn8pL7HJFYMFhhhW", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10280, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VCdFR9Dj2yoNLbE8Dxfxts", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10580, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VCdFR9Dj2yoNLbE8Dxfxts", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10580, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VCdFR9Dj2yoNLbE8Dxfxts", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13411, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TeQvYWCCX2JET2BrMGZwJ4", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17411, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TeQvYWCCX2JET2BrMGZwJ4", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17411, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TeQvYWCCX2JET2BrMGZwJ4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19658, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019EjpWizaWQFXXdkdhSnYsq", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19958, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019EjpWizaWQFXXdkdhSnYsq", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19958, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019EjpWizaWQFXXdkdhSnYsq", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19958, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RXkhozrPgdNc5ztWMK6E5t", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20258, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RXkhozrPgdNc5ztWMK6E5t", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20258, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RXkhozrPgdNc5ztWMK6E5t", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24989, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TSPKvMD4u1Yu1BueKF2pqo", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks after it was deployed to production. The error rate was about 18% in us-east, us-west and eu-west. The same build had also been unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. On the first attempt the orchestrator failed after us-east was done, which left the regions on different versions (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). A second attempt completed in all regions. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error, and check why a build that failed in staging was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55589, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TSPKvMD4u1Yu1BueKF2pqo", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55589, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TSPKvMD4u1Yu1BueKF2pqo", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57533, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Utbv4FpT3AnbAqDKHadM2i", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57833, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Utbv4FpT3AnbAqDKHadM2i", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57833, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Utbv4FpT3AnbAqDKHadM2i", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63618, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Version chosen:** checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0, so I rolled back to that. It has run healthy in production before, so it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- **First attempt:** this stopped partway because of an orchestrator error. us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt:** I ran the rollback again and it completed in all regions.\n- **Result:** all three regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api):** the request timed out, but when I checked the incident list it had been created. I didn't send it again, so the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- **What it records:** the failed release, the half-finished first rollback and the current state.\n- **Follow-ups in the incident:**\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 reached production when its staging build (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EfC9CBasDFjWZ3nFQtePWd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017AtpMbzD694uj9Ko7XcaLa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012NviShNn8pL7HJFYMFhhhW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VCdFR9Dj2yoNLbE8Dxfxts", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I'll try it once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01TeQvYWCCX2JET2BrMGZwJ4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019EjpWizaWQFXXdkdhSnYsq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RXkhozrPgdNc5ztWMK6E5t", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01TSPKvMD4u1Yu1BueKF2pqo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks after it was deployed to production. The error rate was about 18% in us-east, us-west and eu-west. The same build had also been unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. On the first attempt the orchestrator failed after us-east was done, which left the regions on different versions (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). A second attempt completed in all regions. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error, and check why a build that failed in staging was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Utbv4FpT3AnbAqDKHadM2i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Version chosen:** checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0, so I rolled back to that. It has run healthy in production before, so it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- **First attempt:** this stopped partway because of an orchestrator error. us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt:** I ran the rollback again and it completed in all regions.\n- **Result:** all three regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api):** the request timed out, but when I checked the incident list it had been created. I didn't send it again, so the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- **What it records:** the failed release, the half-finished first rollback and the current state.\n- **Follow-ups in the incident:**\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 reached production when its staging build (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy.", "type": "text"}]}]}